<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h3 id=3D"Integration-AdditionalInformation">Additional Information</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Automatically creating variables to store response data.</strong=
> In the Test Panel, if you select Test, then select a property value in th=
e response body, this panel will automatically create a variable that store=
s that value. You can create variables for the response data you need this =
way, selecting them from the Test Panel instead of configuring them by hand=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Article Reference: </strong><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassi=
an.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3427041281/Generic+Integrations" data-linked-r=
esource-id=3D"3427041281" data-linked-resource-version=3D"10" data-linked-r=
esource-type=3D"page">Generic Integrations</a></p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
